It does NOT cover the following, which remain the property of their authors:
- The female werewolf meshes (Data/meshes/.../coronerra/fluffy/2T/femalebodywerewolf_*.nif):
  edited from HDT Werewolves (Duzellx et al.) and its "MFA and Growl Patch".
  Any finalized/redistributed version that uses this female body needs Duzellx's permission.
- The male werewolf meshes (Data/meshes/.../coronerra/fluffy/malebodywerewolf_*.nif):
  edited (head unlinked, fur shells added) from BakaFactory's Animated Beasts Cocks (ABC).
- The fur shell textures (Data/textures/.../coronerra/*_shell.dds): built from the ABC and
  HDT Werewolves body diffuse textures and the Fluffworks fur-shell alpha pattern.
- Records and data referenced from Growl, Monster Lip Sync (MFA), JS Emissive Eyes and
  the Skyrim base game / DLC.
